  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nGiven: 32 * 16 * 8 * 2 * 3 * 5 * 5\n\nChecking the given options:\n\nOption 1) -, +, ÷, =, ×, +\n\n⇒ 32 - 16 + __**8 ÷ 2**__ = __**3 × 5**__ + 5\n\n⇒ __**32**__ - 16 __**+**____** 4**__ = __**15**____** + 5**__\n\n⇒ __**36**____** - 16**__ = 20\n\n⇒ **20**** = 20.**\n\n**L.H.S = R.H.S**\n\n**Here, the equation is satisfied.**\n\nOption 2) +, -, ÷, ×, =, +\n\n⇒ 32 + 16 - __**8 ÷ 2 × 3**__ = __**5 + 5**__\n\n⇒ __**32 + 16**__ - 12 = 10\n\n⇒ __**48 - 12**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 36 ≠ 10.\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\nOption 3) -, +, ÷, ×, =, +\n\n⇒ 32 - 16 + __**8 ÷ 2 × 3**__ = __**5 + 5**__\n\n⇒ __**32**__ - 16 __**+**____** 12**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __**44**____** - 16**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 28 ≠ 10.\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\nOption 4) -, +, ×, =, ÷, +\n\n⇒ 32 - 16 + __**8 × 2**__ = __**3 ÷ 5**__ + 5\n\n⇒ __**32**__ - 16 __**+ **____**16**__ = __3 ÷ 5__ + 5\n\n⇒ **__48 - 16__** = __**0.6**____** + 5**__\n\n⇒ 32 ≠ 5.6.\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\"**.",
